# Authored concepts for the output policy. No conformance is implied.
meanings
  cnl-default
    defined-by concept
    role output-constraint
    precondition "The output policy refers to this concept."
    effect "A requested output profile combining controlled-language clarity constraints. Selecting this profile is not evidence that every constraint passed."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Inspect this concept independently of its selected output spelling."
    grounding "https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1584"
